    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081420/extras/af1a73e85571c188cf71fa0784ea9c39.poster.avif?t=1753028298\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081420/extras/af1a73e85571c188cf71fa0784ea9c39.webm?t=1753028298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081420/extras/af1a73e85571c188cf71fa0784ea9c39.mp4?t=1753028298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In the thrilling adventure &quot;SPACEMAN,&quot; your goal is to ascend the vast heights of space. Beginning with a single step, you\u2019ll set out on an extraordinary quest among the stars.<br><br>One wrong move could send you floating into the Blackhole Below.<br><br>SPACEMAN challenges you to navigate treacherous celestial landscapes, battling gravity and the vast emptiness of space. Each jump and climb tests your skill and precision. Can you overcome the obstacles and reach the top, or will the lack of gravity make it too tough? Find out in this exciting test of perseverance and agility.<br><br>Prepare for the climb of your life. Remember, this won't be easy.",
    "about_the_game": "In the thrilling adventure &quot;SPACEMAN,&quot; your goal is to ascend the vast heights of space. Beginning with a single step, you\u2019ll set out on an extraordinary quest among the stars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne wrong move could send you floating into the Blackhole Below.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSPACEMAN challenges you to navigate treacherous celestial landscapes, battling gravity and the vast emptiness of space. Each jump and climb tests your skill and precision. Can you overcome the obstacles and reach the top, or will the lack of gravity make it too tough? Find out in this exciting test of perseverance and agility.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare for the climb of your life. Remember, this won't be easy.",
    "short_description": "Conquer the heights of space by navigating treacherous landscapes. Battle gravity and test your skill to reach the top. Get ready for the climb of your life.",
